## Integration acceptance

- Check clustered markers, two entities at the same point, missing coordinates and failed tiles independently.
- Test controls and text alternatives with keyboard, touch, enlarged text and dark mode; retain readable provider attribution.
- Verify no location request, movement or new sharing is triggered by opening the documentation or changing palettes.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

